    "description": "This API provides access to the historical data of rideshare rides, allowing users to retrieve a detailed history of their completed trips. It serves as a valuable resource for customers looking to analyze their rideshare usage, understand spending patterns, or report issues. By fetching ride history, users can track their rides, view timestamps, and access fare information. This API is typically utilized by rideshare users who require insights into their past rides for personal or business purposes.",
